  gap(7)/gap(6) = 5.6977
  gap(8)/gap(7) = 7.5571
  gap(9)/gap(8) = 12.9325

3. gap(n) / (n-2)!:
  gap(3) / 1! = 2.000000 = 2
  gap(4) / 2! = 2.500000 = 5/2
