  gap(8) / D(8) = 1.1718 = 3703/3160
  gap(9) / D(9) = 0.8719 = 47889/54928

6. Check recurrence a(n) = c1*a(n-1) + c2*a(n-2):
  Trying c1 = 24/5, c2 = -2
  a(5) = 24/5*5 + -2*2 = 20, actual = 20, OK
  a(6) = 24/5*20 + -2*5 = 86, actual = 86, OK
  a(7) = 24/5*86 + -2*20 = 1864/5, actual = 490, FAIL
  a(8) = 24/5*490 + -2*86 = 2180, actual = 3703, FAIL
  a(9) = 24/5*3703 + -2*490 = 83972/5, actual = 47889, FAIL

7. Try a(n) = f(n)*a(n-1) + g(n)*a(n-2):
  n=5: if g=-1, f = (a(n)+a(n-2))/a(n-1) = 4.4000
  n=6: if g=-1, f = (a(n)+a(n-2))/a(n-1) = 4.5500
  n=7: if g=-1, f = (a(n)+a(n-2))/a(n-1) = 5.9302
  n=8: if g=-1, f = (a(n)+a(n-2))/a(n-1) = 7.7327
  n=9: if g=-1, f = (a(n)+a(n-2))/a(n-1) = 13.0648

8. Try a(n) = (n-1)*a(n-1) - something:
  a(4) - 3*a(3) = -1
  a(5) - 4*a(4) = 0
  a(6) - 5*a(5) = -14
  a(7) - 6*a(6) = -26
  a(8) - 7*a(7) = 273
  a(9) - 8*a(8) = 18265

9. Try a(n) = n*a(n-1) - something:
