  a(6) - 6*a(5) = -34
  a(7) - 7*a(6) = -112
  a(8) - 8*a(7) = -217
  a(9) - 9*a(8) = 14562

10. Check: is edge_orbits = T_n/2 + (n-2)! correct?
  n=3: edge_orbits = 1+1 = 2, gap = 2-1 = 1, expected gap = 2, FAIL
  n=4: edge_orbits = 4+2 = 6, gap = 6-5 = 1, expected gap = 5, FAIL
  n=5: edge_orbits = 32+6 = 38, gap = 38-30 = 8, expected gap = 20, FAIL
  n=6: edge_orbits = 512+24 = 536, gap = 536-290 = 246, expected gap = 86, FAIL
  n=7: edge_orbits = 16384+120 = 16504, gap = 16504-4086 = 12418, expected gap = 490, FAIL
  n=8: edge_orbits = 1048576+720 = 1049296, gap = 1049296-91161 = 958135, expected gap = 3703, FAIL
  n=9: edge_orbits = 134217728+5040 = 134222768, gap = 134222768-3380751 = 130842017, expected gap = 47889, FAIL

